  "notes": "2-channel compressor/limiter/gate (19\" rack, IEC mains). Per channel: balanced inputs and outputs on XLR and 6.35 mm TRS (the two output connectors are wired in parallel). Unbalanced 6.35 mm SIDECHAIN SEND and RETURN per channel (the return is a control input, not part of the audio path); hard bypass links input to output when the channel is OUT or unpowered. OPERATING LEVEL switch: -10 dBV or +4 dBu. XLR genders follow the usual convention (not stated).",
